    '<div class="pbar"><div class="ci2" style="left:' + (r.pLo*100) + "%;width:" + ((r.pHi-r.pLo)*100) + '%"></div><div class="fill" style="left:0;width:' + (r.p*100) + '%"></div></div>' +
    (isFinite(base) ? '<div class="pbar-lab"><span>0%</span><span>peer base rate ' + fmtPct(base) + "</span><span>100%</span></div>" : '<div class="pbar-lab"><span>0%</span><span>peer base rate — no live peers in category (prior ' + fmtPct(cat.launchRate) + ')</span><span>100%</span></div>') +
    (r.peersN > 0 ? '<div class="kv"><span class="k">Peer cohort record</span><span class="v">' + r.peersLaunched + " of " + r.peersN + " launched ≤ 12m (prior-based)</span></div>" : '<div class="kv"><span class="k">Peer cohort record</span><span class="v">no live-token peers in this category</span></div>') +
    '<div class="kv"><span class="k">Category launch rate</span><span class="v">' + fmtPct(cat.launchRate) + " · n=" + cat.nCat + " live peers</span></div>" +
    '<div class="kv"><span class="k">P(3× | launch)</span><span class="v">' + fmtPct(r.p3x) + " of launched peers</span></div>" +
    '<div class="kv"><span class="k">Unconditional P(3×)</span><span class="v">' + fmtPct(r.p * r.p3x) + " — not the same number</span></div>" +
    '<div class="kv"><span class="k">Break-even P(launch)</span><span class="v">' + (r.breakeven > 1 ? ">100% — cannot break even" : fmtPct(r.breakeven)) + "</span></div>" +
    '<div class="note">Odds come from the peers&rsquo; record, not from the token&rsquo;s own promises: the peer multiples on this board are fitted from the snapshot&rsquo;s 128 priced live-token comparables; the logistic coefficients are Phase 1 priors, scored on launches they never saw (temporal hold-out + 5-fold CV). Top-decile TVL-velocity peers launched at <b>41.7%</b> within 12m (n = 48, Phase 1 calibration set).</div>';
